      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This proposal sets out a practical plan to modernize the shared workspace. The project brings document creation, review, and delivery into one consistent workflow across teams."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Project objectives"
        }
      ],
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Establish a single workspace for project documentation."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Simplify the review and approval process."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Give every team clear ownership of its deliverables."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Scope of work"
        }
      ],
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The first phase covers discovery, workspace design, and a pilot rollout. Findings from the pilot will inform training and the implementation schedule."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Delivery milestones"
        }
      ],
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Discovery and alignment · Design review · Pilot release · Team rollout"
        }
      ]
